@DotnetApiSample.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5291

### List products
GET {{DotnetApiSample.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

###

### Get product by id
GET {{DotnetApiSample.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Create product
POST {{DotnetApiSample.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pour-over Set",
  "sku": "POV-004",
  "price": 32.00
}

###

### Update product
PUT {{DotnetApiSample.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Espresso Machine",
  "sku": "ESP-001",
  "price": 279.00
}

###

### Delete product
DELETE {{DotnetApiSample.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products/4

###
